{"unit_id": "HB00__dsh-llm-failover#card-zh", "repo": "HB00/dsh-llm-failover", "commit": "919272faf9f9eb0d379b70f45c5612c1d5aa47a5", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-llm-failover 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的模型提供方故障转移插件，通过 agent/request 与 agent/request-error 流程在限流或配额耗尽后切换提供方。它按配置顺序选择未处于冷却期的提供方，可为每个提供方指定模型，并用最后一项作为固定兜底；连续失败阈值和冷却时长均可配置。切换时会在会话投影中提供提示，Web 界面包含输入区提示条和插件设置卡片，可直接编辑路由。适合需要在多个模型提供方之间自动恢复请求的 DSH 用户。配置 provider 路由即可使用，不需要插件单独配置 API 密钥。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:183-221", "lib/client.js:413-429"]}
{"unit_id": "HB00__dsh-llm-failover#card-en", "repo": "HB00/dsh-llm-failover", "commit": "919272faf9f9eb0d379b70f45c5612c1d5aa47a5", "type": "card", "lang": "en", "text": "dsh-llm-failover adds provider failover to DSH Web. After rate-limit or quota failures, it cools the provider and switches to the next available route, with an optional model per route and a fixed final fallback. A settings card edits routes and retry timing; a notice appears in the composer.", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:183-221", "lib/client.js:413-429"]}
