{"unit_id": "HB00__dsh-llm-failover#feature-1", "repo": "HB00/dsh-llm-failover", "commit": "919272faf9f9eb0d379b70f45c5612c1d5aa47a5", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-llm-failover 的功能「按顺序切换提供方」：遇到 RATE_LIMIT 或 QUOTA 连续失败达到阈值后冷却当前提供方，并在下一次请求选择后续可用项；列表末项作为固定兜底。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:203-221"]}
